      "summaries": {
        "en": "Data Engineering Zoomcamp is a free 9-week course that teaches you to build production-ready data pipelines from scratch. It covers containerization with Docker, workflow orchestration with Kestra, batch processing with Spark, and streaming with Kafka, plus data warehousing and analytics engineering with dbt. The hands-on curriculum culminates in a capstone project where you apply all skills to a real-world dataset. Ideal for aspiring data engineers, it offers a structured path to practical, job-ready expertise.",
        "zh": "Data Engineering Zoomcamp 是一个为期9周的免费课程，旨在教你从零构建生产级数据管道。课程涵盖Docker容器化、Kestra工作流编排、Spark批处理、Kafka流处理，以及数据仓库和dbt分析工程。通过动手实践和最终项目，你将掌握现代数据工程的核心技能。适合想进入数据工程领域的开发者，提供了一条结构化的学习路径，让你快速获得实战能力。",
        "es": "Data Engineering Zoomcamp is a free 9-week course that teaches you to build production-ready data pipelines from scratch. It covers containerization with Docker, workflow orchestration with Kestra, batch processing with Spark, and streaming with Kafka, plus data warehousing and analytics engineering with dbt. The hands-on curriculum culminates in a capstone project where you apply all skills to a real-world dataset. Ideal for aspiring data engineers, it offers a structured path to practical, job-ready expertise.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "data-engineering-zoomcamp stands out for course, data-engineering, and dbt in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Data Engineering Zoomcamp is a free 9-week course that teaches you to build production-ready data pipelines from scratch. It covers containerization with Docker, workflow orchestration with Kestra, batch processing with Spark, and streaming with Kafka, plus data warehousing and analytics engineering with dbt. The hands-on curriculum culminates in a capstone project where you apply all skills to a real-world dataset. Ideal for aspiring data engineers, it offers a structured path to practical, job-ready expertise.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/DataTalksClub/data-engineering-zoomcamp for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
