      "summaries": {
        "en": "LiteParse is a fast, open-source document parser that extracts text and structure from PDFs and images with high accuracy. Its key innovation is a Rust-based OCR pipeline optimized for speed and reliability, outperforming many Python alternatives. You can use it as a CLI tool or integrate it via its API for tasks like automated data extraction, document indexing, or preprocessing for RAG systems.",
        "zh": "LiteParse是一款快速开源文档解析器，能从PDF和图片中高精度提取文本与结构。其核心优势在于基于Rust构建的OCR流水线，通过内存安全与并发优化实现远超Python方案的解析速度与稳定性。技术亮点为模块化设计，支持自定义预处理与后处理步骤，便于针对特定文档调优。用户可通过命令行快速试用，或将其API集成至自动化数据提取、文档索引、RAG预处理等流程。适用于高效处理大量扫描件或复杂排版文档的场景。",
        "es": "LiteParse is a fast, open-source document parser that extracts text and structure from PDFs and images with high accuracy. Its key innovation is a Rust-based OCR pipeline optimized for speed and reliability, outperforming many Python alternatives. You can use it as a CLI tool or integrate it via its API for tasks like automated data extraction, document indexing, or preprocessing for RAG systems.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "liteparse stands out for document-ocr, document-processing, and ocr in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "LiteParse is a fast, open-source document parser that extracts text and structure from PDFs and images with high accuracy. Its key innovation is a Rust-based OCR pipeline optimized for speed and reliability, outperforming many Python alternatives. You can use it as a CLI tool or integrate it via its API for tasks like automated data extraction, document indexing, or preprocessing for RAG systems.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/run-llama/liteparse for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
